OL,3,GNEWSAStephen Graham father-son book
OL,4,A'really special'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Brighton-based lecturer who worked
OL,7,Fwith Adolescence creator and star
OL,8,FStephen Graham on a book exploring
OL,9,Fmanhood says there is "something really
OL,10,Fspecial" about how it has come
OL,11,Ftogether.
OL,13,FEmmy-winning actor Graham invited
OL,14,Fpeople to share their experiences for a
OL,15,Fbook called Letters to Our Sons,
OL,16,Fpublished on Thursday.
OL,18,FOrly Klein, who described the
OL,19,Fcollaboration with Graham as "an
OL,20,Famazing stroke of luck", said while big
OL,21,Fnames pepper the book, it makes clear
OL,22,Fthat fatherhood is a "great leveller".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
